OL,3,AState failing to keep public safe,
OL,4,Awarns victims' commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victims' commissioner for England
OL,7,Fand Wales has said the state is failing
OL,8,Fto keep the public safe, as she urged
OL,9,FAndy Burnham to put the justice system
OL,10,Fat the heart of his 10-year plan for
OL,11,Fgovernment.
OL,13,FClaire Waxman told the BBC that she
OL,14,Fwould press the prime minister to
OL,15,Fcommit to reforms in the decade-long
OL,16,Fblueprint, which he is set to unveil
OL,17,Fnext month.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
