OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AState failing to keep public safe,
OL,4,Awarns victims' commissioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe warned that the early release of
OL,7,Fprisoners to ease overcrowding in
OL,8,Fjails, along with long waits in the
OL,9,Fcourts, had eroded the trust of crime
OL,10,Fvictims to come forward.
OL,12,FIt comes as the commissioner's latest
OL,13,Fannual survey of victims, to be
OL,14,Fpublished on Tuesday, found many had
OL,15,Fexperienced long waits for justice.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
